                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section id="features" class="bg-slate-50 py-24 dark:bg-slate-950">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="space-y-24">
            <!-- Row 1 -->
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-12 md:flex-row">
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                        Optimize your risk processes and accomplish more
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                        Keep every risk, control, and action item in one live workspace. Track exposure from
                        tender to handover, see what is overdue, and make decisions backed by real data instead
                        of scattered spreadsheets.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                    <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 p-4 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800">
                        <img src="~/images/feature-risk-register.png" alt="Risk register and approvals view"
                             class="w-full rounded-2xl object-cover" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Row 2 -->
            <div class="flex flex-col-reverse items-center gap-12 md:flex-row">
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                    <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 p-4 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800">
                        <img src="~/images/feature-team-collaboration.png" alt="Team collaboration and approvals"
                             class="w-full rounded-2xl object-cover" />
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                        Boost team collaboration and approvals
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                        Give site engineers, QS, and management a shared view of open risks, pending approvals,
                        and who is responsible next. Automated reminders keep items moving so nothing slips past
                        your compliance thresholds.
                    </p>
                    <button class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-sky-600 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md transition hover:bg-sky-700">
                        See how Sentro fits your team
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Row 3 -->
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-12 md:flex-row">
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                        Build your ideal workflow and save more time
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                        Configure checklists, categories, and escalation rules to match how your firm already
